Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:22:57.29,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k13\blur5}All {\k44}eyes {\k15}on {\k14}me, {\k41}strong {\k14}and {\k34}grand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:22:59.03,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k44\blur5}I {\k24}must {\k22}be {\k17}the {\k28}great{\k26}er
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.17,0:23:00.68,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k39\blur5}I {\k31}must {\k16}be {\k18}the {\k24}sav{\k23}ior
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.77,0:23:02.63,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k19\blur5}All {\k47}eyes {\k22}on {\k25}me, {\k17}here {\k24}and {\k32}now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.63,0:23:04.51,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k21\blur5}They {\k34}say {\k22}I'm {\k25}their {\k18}mes{\k29}si{\k39}ah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:07.91,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k24\blur5}All {\k25}of {\k19}the {\k21}hopes {\k15}and {\k31}dreams {\k30}are {\k17}in {\k21}this {\k22}bro{\k23}ken {\k21}tam{\k12}bou{\k15}rine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:11.75,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k48\blur5}Make {\k23}the {\k20}si{\k26}lent {\k21}tam{\k17}bou{\k24}rine {\k45}sing {\k25}like {\k19}how {\k16}it {\k31}used {\k21}to {\k34}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.07,0:23:15.01,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k23\blur5}Come {\k21}wit{\k22}ness {\k38}the {\k34}birth {\k41}of {\k24}the {\k24}great{\k20}est {\k19}lone{\k15}li{\k13}ness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.25,0:23:18.66,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k39\blur5}In {\k20}this {\k24}ho{\k23}llow {\k33}still{\k38}ness, {\k40}now {\k24}tell {\k22}me {\k18}what {\k19}will {\k24}you {\k17}choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.79,0:23:22.18,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k33\blur5}Dy{\k52}ing, {\k43}dy{\k46}ing, {\k45}dy{\k22}ing {\k21}or {\k47}liv{\k30}ing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:27.33,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k31\blur5}Dy{\k53}ing, {\k40}dy{\k53}ing, {\k36}dy{\k27}ing {\k25}or {\k48}liv{\k186}ing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.17,0:22:11.37,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Viaje por mil anos, nade pelas ondas
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.74,0:22:14.85,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Encontre meu corpo flutuando no tempo e no espaço
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.32,0:22:18.30,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}De uma terra tão selvagem e tão desolada
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.84,0:22:22.03,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Mais uma polegada, estarei alcançando o portão da lua
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.53,0:22:25.39,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Dentro e fora, respiro com o passar do tempo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.91,0:22:29.03,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Aqui hoje vem a sentença da minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.53,0:22:32.56,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Qual é a pergunta ardente que procura?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.97,0:22:37.55,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}O que exatamente você ainda quer de mim?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.51,0:22:43.38,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Pronto, pronto
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.70,0:22:45.30,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Veja como você é minúsculo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.48,0:22:47.00,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Veja como você é frágil
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.19,0:22:48.75,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Veja como você é indefeso
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.98,0:22:50.43,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Eu posso ver o que você é
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.80,0:22:53.74,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Por que você não pega minha mão, pega minha mão amiga?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.89,0:22:55.37,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Eu devo ser o herói
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:22:57.29,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Todos os olhos em mim, fortes e grandiosos
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:22:59.03,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Eu devo ser o maior
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.17,0:23:00.68,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Eu devo ser o salvador
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.77,0:23:02.63,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Todos os olhos em mim, aqui e agora
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.63,0:23:04.51,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Dizem que eu sou o messias deles
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:07.91,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Todas as esperanças e sonhos estão neste pandeiro quebrado
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:11.75,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Fazer o tamborim silencioso cantar como era antes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.07,0:23:15.01,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Venha testemunhar o nascimento da maior solidão
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.25,0:23:18.66,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Nesta quietude oca, agora me diga o que você vai escolher?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.79,0:23:22.18,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Morrer, morrer, morrer ou viver?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:27.33,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Morrer, morrer, morrer ou viver?
